# Local environment files.
#
# `.env` holds VITE_API_KEY, which Vite bakes into the bundle at build time —
# so the key is public on the deployed site by necessity. It is still kept
# out of THIS REPO, which is public on GitHub: a key in git history is
# permanent, is harvested by credential scrapers within minutes, and would
# need a history rewrite plus rotation with KSOU to undo.
#
# Nothing is lost by ignoring it. The build reads .env from the machine that
# runs `npm run build`, not from the repository. `.env.example` documents the
# variables for anyone setting that machine up.
.env
.env.local
.env.*.local
